DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
26527::$$$message_0196_0000_0000$$$::I'll do the prep for tomorrow's breakfast and finish the dishes I've put off.[lr]::
26528::$$$message_0196_0000_0001$$$::I quickly finish the prep and scrub a greasy frying pan. Meanwhile, everyone's relaxing in the living room after dinner and playing cards.::
26529::$$$message_0196_0001_0000$$$::I think an hour has passed with them at it.[lr]::
26530::$$$message_0196_0001_0001$$$::At first, it was a peaceful time spent teaching Saber and Rider the rules...but now, from a distance, it doesn't seem to be the case anymore.::
26531::$$$message_0196_0002_0000$$$::Rider [chgfg time=300 storage=藤08d(中) textoff=0]reaches for the card to her right.[lr]::
26532::$$$message_0196_0002_0001$$$::Rider [chgfg time=300 storage=藤08e(中) textoff=0]reaches for the card to her left.[lr]::
26533::$$$message_0196_0002_0002$$$::Rider casually takes the left card.::
26534::$$$message_0196_0003_0000$$$::"Wha, you saw through me in no time at all!?[lr]::
26535::$$$message_0196_0003_0001$$$::How? Why? Whyyy!?"[lr]::
26536::$$$message_0196_0003_0002$$$::It doesn't bear explaining.[lr]::
26537::$$$message_0196_0003_0003$$$::After some twists and turns, they ended up playing old maid. But games that require a poker face aren't for Fuji-nee. Definitely not.::
26538::$$$message_0196_0004_0000$$$::"You're too good at this, Rider.[lr]::
26539::$$$message_0196_0004_0001$$$::You've got to be reading my mind. Or you've got someone helping you![cacheimage storage=藤fd特殊02e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤fd特殊02e(中) last=藤02c腕c(中)] For example, that house-husband there! Who washes a frying pan for thirty minutes!?"::
26540::$$$message_0196_0005_0000$$$::Fuji-nee points at the kitchen.[lr]::
26541::$$$message_0196_0005_0001$$$::Rider's back is towards me, though.[lr]::
26542::$$$message_0196_0005_0002$$$::If any cheating could happen, it would be me reading Rider's hand and telling Fuji-nee.::
26543::$$$message_0196_0006_0000$$$::"Yeah, yeah. Stop being lame and enjoy the game. Then lose all your matches and run home crying to the Fujimura Group."[lr]::
26544::$$$message_0196_0006_0001$$$::The pan makes squeaky sounds as I scrub it.::
26545::$$$message_0196_0007_0000$$$::"Ngh, nnnnrgh![lr]::
26546::$$$message_0196_0007_0001$$$::How dare you talk to me like that, little one. Hmph! I won't lose. I'll keep going until I win![lr]::
26547::$$$message_0196_0007_0002$$$::It's just a game of chance. My win-loss record will even out if we play close to a hundred rounds!"::
26548::$$$message_0196_0008_0000$$$::I hear her howling.[lr]::
26549::$$$message_0196_0008_0001$$$::What kind of game does she think this is, where she needs to play a hundred matches to figure out who's better at it?[lr]::
26550::$$$message_0196_0008_0002$$$::It's a game that depends on both luck and skill, so individual skill won't be clear after one or even ten matches.[lr]::
26551::$$$message_0196_0008_0003$$$::Some say that skill isn't determined by a single match, but over a long span of time.::
26552::$$$message_0196_0009_0000$$$::Fuji-nee is doomed if she's going with that.[lr]::
26553::$$$message_0196_0009_0001$$$::A hundred matches won't average out into a draw. It'll show exactly how strong each player is.[lr]::
26554::$$$message_0196_0009_0002$$$::Come to think of it, a meijin-ranked shogi master once said that three games would be enough to gauge the opponent, I think.[lr]::
26555::$$$message_0196_0009_0003$$$::Anyway...::
26556::$$$message_0196_0010_0000$$$::Fuji-nee's face is too easy to read as always, [chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服08d(中),藤08e(中) textoff=0]and Sakura looks apologetic next to her as she takes another card.[lr]::
26557::$$$message_0196_0010_0001$$$::It goes without saying that Fuji-nee finishes last.::
26558::$$$message_0196_0011_0000$$$::"Oooough, this doesn't make sense! Are you a psychic, Sakura!? [cacheimage storage=桜私服07d(中),藤fd特殊02b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07d(中),藤fd特殊02b(中) last=,藤02c腕b(中) textoff=0][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]You're so mean! How long have you been hiding that!?"[lr]::
26559::$$$message_0196_0011_0001$$$::Rich coming from someone who'd abuse that to cosmic proportions if she had such powers. ::
26560::$$$message_0196_0012_0000$$$::"Ahaha. Um, Ms. Fujimura? Why don't we play a different game?"[lr]::
26561::$$$message_0196_0012_0001$$$::"...Like what?"[lr]::
26562::$$$message_0196_0012_0002$$$::"Um..."::
26563::$$$message_0196_0013_0000$$$::She must be thinking of a game that doesn't require you to hide your emotions.[lr]::
26564::$$$message_0196_0013_0001$$$::That immediately rules out I-doubt-it and president, then.[lr]::
26565::$$$message_0196_0013_0002$$$::Concentration and wilderness would cause chaos by their very nature, and the complicated rules would be hard to explain to the other two.::
26566::$$$message_0196_0014_0000$$$::"How about blackjack?"[lr]::
26567::$$$message_0196_0014_0001$$$::"Oh. Nice, let's go with that."::
26568::$$$message_0196_0015_0000$$$::"How do the rules work?"::
26569::$$$message_0196_0016_0000$$$::Sakura plays with Fuji-nee to explain the rules.[lr]::
26570::$$$message_0196_0016_0001$$$::There aren't many hands to memorize like poker, and it's a brisk, combative game that can count up players' points quickly.[lr]::
26571::$$$message_0196_0016_0002$$$::You won't necessarily lose even if people can read what's on your face...::
26572::$$$message_0196_0017_0000$$$::"Aaaah! Bust after bust! I-is this the infamous sunk-cost fallacy I've heard about!?"[lr]::
26573::$$$message_0196_0017_0001$$$::Still, blackjack isn't for people who don't know when to hit the brakes.::
26574::$$$message_0196_0018_0000$$$::Now...[lr]::
26575::$$$message_0196_0018_0001$$$::Blackjack starts everyone on equal ground, but it's even more competitive than old maid.::
26576::$$$message_0196_0019_0000$$$::"Ace of spades... Sorry, I hit blackjack."[lr]::
26577::$$$message_0196_0019_0001$$$::Right.[lr]::
26578::$$$message_0196_0019_0002$$$::Fuji-nee has a lot of face cards, and Rider is innately clever. They both hold out for a while, but it ends in Saber's overwhelming victory.::
26579::$$$message_0196_0020_0000$$$::She's terrifyingly good at drawing cards, and all but certain to win if her count is higher than her opponents'. Her sense for victory feels supernatural.[lr]::
26580::$$$message_0196_0020_0001$$$::...Gradually, the rules shift, and Saber basically becomes the dealer versus the other three.::
26581::$$$message_0196_0021_0000$$$::However...[lr]::
26582::$$$message_0196_0021_0001$$$::They have a critical weakness, if they intend to face Saber the dragon.::
26583::$$$message_0196_0022_0000$$$::Sakura and Rider have similarly bad luck. They don't draw good cards and rarely achieve scores that can win.::
26584::$$$message_0196_0023_0000$$$::"Hyoooh! I went over 21 again!"[lr]::
26585::$$$message_0196_0023_0001$$$::Of course, Fuji-nee is too eager and repeatedly busts.::
26586::$$$message_0196_0024_0000$$$::Still, I sometimes think that she's the only one with a chance of beating Saber.::
26587::$$$message_0196_0025_0000$$$::"...It still ended up being a contest of luck, but the kind you're born with."[lr]::
26588::$$$message_0196_0025_0001$$$::Next is wilderness.[lr]::
26589::$$$message_0196_0025_0002$$$::Truly a showdown between dragon and tiger.::
26590::$$$message_0196_0026_0000$$$::"Tch... I'm going to raise my rate, Saber! [wvl][sestop time=1000 nowait=1]You and me, one-on-one![lr]::
26591::$$$message_0196_0026_0001$$$::Why don't we play best of ten and bet a dinner side dish?"::
26592::$$$message_0196_0027_0000$$$::"...Hm. Quite a bold challenge, Taiga.[lr]::
26593::$$$message_0196_0027_0001$$$::So whoever loses will go hungry..."::
26594::$$$message_0196_0028_0000$$$::"That's right. Heh heh heh. Is that too much for you, Saber?[lr]::
26595::$$$message_0196_0028_0001$$$::Come on. Do you have the courage to accept the challenge?"::
26596::$$$message_0196_0029_0000$$$::"...Hrm. I didn't want to be competitive for a game after supper...[lr]::
26597::$$$message_0196_0029_0001$$$::...Very well. I'll use my full effort for a battle as grave as this. I'm sorry, but you're going to go hungry, Taiga."[lr]::
26598::$$$message_0196_0029_0002$$$::Saber grins confidently.[lr]::
26599::$$$message_0196_0029_0003$$$::"Wha!? You weren't really trying, Saber!?"[lr]::
26600::$$$message_0196_0029_0004$$$::"It would burn calories, after all."::
26601::$$$message_0196_0030_0000$$$::And yet...[lr]::
26602::$$$message_0196_0030_0001$$$::I can already tell that no matter who wins, I'll be the one to lose. One will dine well while the other goes hungry. Therein lies the spark of revolt.[lr]::
26603::$$$message_0196_0030_0002$$$::As the handler of the household finances, I can't allow this to increase our dinner expenses by an entire dish.::
26604::$$$message_0196_0031_0000$$$::"Okay. Let's settle down.[lr]::
26605::$$$message_0196_0031_0001$$$::I made tea, so everyone take a break."[lr]::
26606::$$$message_0196_0031_0002$$$::I wedge my way into the conversation with tea and snacks.[lr]::
26607::$$$message_0196_0031_0003$$$::Fuji-nee reluctantly backs down under Saber's pressure, and Saber easily wraps it up as well.::
26608::$$$message_0196_0032_0000$$$::"So Saber swept the table?"[lr]::
26609::$$$message_0196_0032_0001$$$::"Yes... We couldn't compete at all."[lr]::
26610::$$$message_0196_0032_0002$$$::We chat while we have tea.[lr]::
26611::$$$message_0196_0032_0003$$$::...For some reason, nobody besides Saber is reaching for the snacks.::
26612::$$$message_0196_0033_0000$$$::"Hm? What's wrong?"[lr]::
26613::$$$message_0196_0033_0001$$$::"To the victor go the spoils..."[lr]::
26614::$$$message_0196_0033_0002$$$::"Sakura, I resent the way you phrased that. It was Taiga who proposed the stakes initially."[lr]::
26615::$$$message_0196_0033_0003$$$::"...Haah. You were gambling from the start?"::
26616::$$$message_0196_0034_0000$$$::"Yes. Taiga suggested that it would motivate us, and that games don't really count unless something important is on the line."[lr]::
26617::$$$message_0196_0034_0001$$$::"Fuji-nee..."[lr]::
26618::$$$message_0196_0034_0002$$$::I look sideways at her, but she's curled up with her back towards me, sleeping.::
26619::$$$message_0196_0035_0000$$$::"I'm using my authority as head of the house to call off the gamble. This is community property, and nobody gets to hog it all.[lr]::
26620::$$$message_0196_0035_0001$$$::But..."[lr]::
26621::$$$message_0196_0035_0002$$$::Fuji-nee freezes halfway through her cheerful waking-up animation.::
26622::$$$message_0196_0036_0000$$$::"As a lesson to you for saying something stupid, you don't get any snacks, Fuji-nee."::
26623::$$$message_0196_0037_0000$$$::"W-what are you talking about, Shirou!? [cacheimage storage=藤02f腕a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=藤02f腕a(中) textoff=0]I don't remember raising you this way!"[lr]::
26624::$$$message_0196_0037_0001$$$::"I don't want to hear it. You should know better as a teacher than to encourage gambling. At least act a little sorry."[lr]::
26625::$$$message_0196_0037_0002$$$::"Waaah! Shirou, you meanie!"[lr]::
26626::$$$message_0196_0037_0003$$$::Fuji-nee kicks her feet like a child.::
26627::$$$message_0196_0038_0000$$$::"Yep, that's me. If you're getting munchies, then have some tea and go home."[lr]::
26628::$$$message_0196_0038_0001$$$::I confiscate her snack and place it in front of Saber.::
26629::$$$message_0196_0039_0000$$$::"Whatever happened, your snack goes to Saber, like you promised.[lr]::
26630::$$$message_0196_0039_0001$$$::...If this happens again, make sure you stop her."::
26631::$$$message_0196_0040_0000$$$::"Y-yes. I'll be careful from now on.[lr]::
26632::$$$message_0196_0040_0001$$$::I'm sorry. I let myself get a little heated."[lr]::
26633::$$$message_0196_0040_0002$$$::Having calmed down, Saber seems to regret hogging the snacks.::
26634::$$$message_0196_0041_0000$$$::"Soft! You're too soft on her, like the way Raiga Fujimura spoils Illya! It's Saber's fault, too! Arrest everyone who gambled![lr]::
26635::$$$message_0196_0041_0001$$$::On that note, I'll have a rice cracker, pretty please."[lr]::
26636::$$$message_0196_0041_0002$$$::Fuji-nee starts munching on a rice cracker.::
26637::$$$message_0196_0042_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
26638::$$$message_0196_0042_0001$$$::It's a typical, exasperating scene, but I did learn something new.[lr]::
26639::$$$message_0196_0042_0002$$$::This was supposed to be a gamble taking place over one hundred matches, but Saber displayed her power through a mere ten matches like a master.::

